    "updated_at": "2016-04-14T21:38:28Z",
    "body": "If `new Document()` creates a `Document` of type `application/xhtml+xml`, that would be inconsistent with loading an `application/xhtml+xml` resource into a browsing context which would instead be `HTMLDocument` (I assumed, but reading #221 maybe `HTMLDocument` can be used only for \"html\" mode documents instead, if it is unmerged...)\n",
